{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_st03","storyGroup":"act44side","storySort":19,"storyDependence":"act44side_level_act44side_08_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AT-ST-3","storyName":"过客","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"星熊回到龙门，萌萌香在御机继续自己的事业。而那位森内此前一直追逐的神明，出现在引发了整场事件，却也是和事件最无关系的人面前。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act44side/level_act44side_st03","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act44side_st03","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":17,"characters":["林雨霞","诗怀雅","文月","星熊","森内","萌萌香","吉星","澪","？？？","议员","神明的声音","久违的神明","沉稳的神职","更纱","阿戈尔男性","埃拉菲亚女性","沉稳的宫司"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_bg_bg_park.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":7},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_livelystreet","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"li","id":8},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"li","fadetime":"2","id":9},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"li","fadetime":"2","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1033_swire2_1#8$1","duration":"1.5","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"她真就写了这么一句话？","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1033_swire2_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诗怀雅","text":"我有必要骗你吗？她的信还在我这儿呢。要看吗？","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_1033_swire2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":20},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"1","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":22},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","volume":"1","id":23},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"（清嗓子）","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"*龙门粗口*，我听说你爷爷被你气走了？！","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"……没有落款，全信完。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"噗。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1033_swire2_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诗怀雅","text":"这你也笑得出来？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_1033_swire2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"第一，我不知道她字写快了居然有点像狂草。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"第二，不是在她亲自把这封信拍在你脸上之后，事情就解释清楚了吗，“诗怀雅局长”？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1033_swire2_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诗怀雅","text":"臭老鼠！要不是那家伙还别别扭扭的，你看我找不找你！","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_1033_swire2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"我本来也不用你找。我们见面越少越好。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1033_swire2_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诗怀雅","text":"你！","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_1033_swire2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诗怀雅","text":"我宣布，你碗里最后一颗鳞丸归我了。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_1033_swire2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"请便，就当是错怪你的赔罪了。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1033_swire2_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诗怀雅","text":"你可真轻描淡写啊，臭老鼠。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_1033_swire2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"那你还想怎样？在新汐斯塔和你爷爷对着干，至少这事不能算我错怪你吧？","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1033_swire2_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诗怀雅","text":"哼。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_1033_swire2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1033_swire2_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诗怀雅","text":"不过你说……我是不是也该找星熊聊聊？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_1033_swire2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"应该，但是不合适。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1033_swire2_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诗怀雅","text":"是啊，我知道她最近要么躲着我，要么就一本正经地叫我官职，但其实我能看出来，我们俩并没有变生分。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_1033_swire2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诗怀雅","text":"毕竟发生了这么多事，她得避嫌，她错怪了我不好意思，还有，毕竟她那边也算是长辈去世……","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_1033_swire2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"她没那么敏感。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1033_swire2_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诗怀雅","text":"是吗？我觉得她偶尔也有点多愁善感……也不能这么说，嗯，我想想，怎么描述她那种状态呢……","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_1033_swire2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"等陈晖洁回来，说不定可以帮你一起想。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"但我的意思是说，她现在那副样子，可能根本就不是因为她想了那么多，只是单纯想拿你寻开心而已。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1033_swire2_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诗怀雅","text":"臭！老！鼠！","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_1033_swire2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诗怀雅","text":"星熊我知根知底，她才不像你，一百个心眼，老奸巨猾！","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_1033_swire2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4080_lin_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"林雨霞","text":"承蒙夸奖。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_4080_lin_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":74},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":76},{"type":"charslot","id":77},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_bg_bg_lungmenbridge.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":79},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$1","focus":"n","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"多谢星熊督察帮我带的伴手礼。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"您客气。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"星熊督察去东国的这段时日，不知怎的，我竟然没少光顾那家姜齐煎饼店，吃到后来，竟然也觉得葱段味道很美。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"不过，据说星熊督察在御机也遭逢不少变故，还能想着替我带东西，这份心意实在是弥足珍贵。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"都是我应该做的。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"再说我在御机也惹了不少麻烦，万幸没闹到惊动夫人，惊动魏先生，让龙门难办那一步。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"没有的事。我听说的都是你智勇双全，不仅洗脱自己的冤屈，还替情同义父的铁斋先生报仇的佳话。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"那个金兵卫本来也不是善类，被捕受审是理所当然。星熊督察心存善念，没有下重手，这才是便宜了他。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"……夫人，我还有一件事想问。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"不必拘泥，问就是了。上次我在街上开快了一点，你别停我的时候也没这么扭扭捏捏的。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我从御机回来之后，其实一直在想……","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"龙门和御机……究竟有何不同？","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"为什么我已经可以心安理得地说自己是龙门人，可御机对我而言，却无论如何也没法再当成一个家？","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"因为林先生对黑道管理有方？因为龙门没有所谓神明？不，原因不该是这些。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"……","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"星熊，一座城市里最重要的，只有人，一个一个的，生活在城市里的，活生生的人。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"是人就会做梦，而一座城里的人在做什么样的梦，这座城市就会传颂什么样的故事。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"夫人是说……？","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"御机在做的梦，龙门早已醒了。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"……","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"好在你仍然在那边交了一些好朋友。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"大概是我这趟回御机最大的收获。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"有收获，那不就很好嘛。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"正好我也有件奇闻要跟督察分享。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"什么事？","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"说是和御机邻近的姬户城，最近出现了一名少年英侠。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"这位侠客把容颜包得严严实实。明明刀法不怎么样，打人却只用一把木刀，还总能用不要命的招数克敌制胜。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"可偏偏就是这么一位看起来不太能成事的少侠，解决了姬户城盘踞多年的诈骗团伙。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"据他自己说，他是从御机一路走到姬户的。他在姬户也不打算多待，休整几天，就要去下一个城市逛逛。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"祝他一路顺利。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"还有一件事，没那么稀奇了，不过也算和星熊督察有关。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"御机有位被撤了职的警察，最近打算竞选议员。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"能选上吗？","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"九成九选不上。但成不了的事，就不去做了吗？","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"是啊。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hgsldpn","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":146},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"1.5","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"好，天也聊得差不多，煎饼也吃得差不多，是时候开始下一轮了。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"夫人今天是换了新车没错，不过我的老伙计可未必会输。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"不曾想，还没发动引擎，气势上就先被星熊督察压了一头啊。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"这身衣服的功劳？","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"百分之三十吧。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_1044_hsgma2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":158},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"charslot","id":161},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_bg_64_g11_odenstall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":162},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_makesoup","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"li","id":163},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"li","fadetime":"2","id":164},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":165},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":166},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"竹轮、白萝卜、驮兽筋。给。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"呼。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"li","fadetime":"3","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"演艺事务所张罗得怎么样了？还顺利吗？","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"有好有坏。不管怎么说，还算是稳步推进中。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"那我就放心了。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"星熊走的时候你哭成那个样子，我还怕你也跟着离开御机去龙门呢。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"不至于，不至于。星熊走有她走的原因，我留下也有我留下的理由。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"嚯，这才多长时间，羽生萌萌香小姐已经有谈判专家的气质了。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"胡说。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":188},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_eatnoodle_single","volume":"0.3","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":190},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"嘶——好烫！","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"慢点慢点。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"呼……烫是烫，但香也是真香啊。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"不过，森内老板，我可能确实会离开御机一段时间。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"星熊说的那个罗德岛？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"对的。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"哪怕我知道，自己现在已经和萌萌香这个名字绑定得更深，深到了骨子里……","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"可我的确也在想，也许，在一个没人认识羽生萌萌香的地方，紫野遥也能短暂地拥有她自己的时光。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"至少星熊认识你。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"别打岔，我很认真的啦！","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"哈哈，知道知道。说不定我也可以去看看，没准能再多交上几个朋友。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"森内老板，你说……这样的日子还能持续多久？","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"突然间怎么了？我不太懂你想说什么。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我说不太清，但我总觉得，这样的日子，可能不会太久了。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"你越说我越糊涂了。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"就是……怎么说呢，仁田街每晚挤满了人，锻冶町的高楼马上就要封顶，我在街上走，十个人里九个人在聊房价大涨的日子……","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我的每场演出都能一夜售空，和粉丝握手握到手都脱了一层皮的日子……","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我总觉得，这样的日子，也许不会太长了。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"瞎想什么呢，战争？北院打过来？","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"也许用不着他们。也许……他们也会被我们卷进来。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"……","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"playsound","key":"$phonevibration","volume":"1","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"唔，来电话了。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"生意？","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"不，是吉星……","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"萌萌香，大新闻！","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"怎么了？楼市暴跌了？","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"哈？你睡醒了吗？今天那个什么新楼盘不是又创新高了吗，哪来的暴跌？","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"我是说更纱啊！","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"更纱？她不是在哲也走后不久也离开御机了吗？","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"她给我寄了封信，信纸上还印着家纹，锦织家的家纹！","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"锦织家……北院四大家族的那个锦织家？！","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"她说前一阵子在御机玩得很开心，但是闹得有点大，怕被家里发现，所以回锁川执行灯下黑战术，等风头过了再来找我们！","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"这还不算大新闻？","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"这……这新闻的确挺大的。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"信上还写了你的事，说她得知你在搞演艺事务所，要是真搞成了，她说不定也加盟一下玩一玩。","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我的事务所？偶像？锦织家的大小姐？！","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"萌萌香，嘘！","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":266},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":267},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"charslot","id":270},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_amb_forestnight_loop","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"for","id":271},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"for","fadetime":"2","id":272},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_bg_bg_ltroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":274},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#1$1","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"如果您没有别的事……","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"不忙。","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你办事很稳，比三船稳当得多。","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"金石会现在归你管，可金石集团还是个烫手山芋，没什么人想接。有没有兴趣收拾他那些七零八落的遗产，带着金石会再尝试一次？","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#2$1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"不了，议员大人。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"也是，收拾他的遗产说说容易，实际做起来，又不知道会有多少艰难险阻在其中。","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"你真的想这样过一辈子？当一个连老巢都丢了的黑帮的大姐头，直到终老？","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#2$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"……也不过是给在社会上无法立足的人硬凑一个家，做些善后工作罢了。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#5$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"再者，假如御机已经不需要金石会，我也不可能永远这么硬撑下去。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"金石会也好，金石集团也好，我都已经待够。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"今天我来，不光是来替三船先生完成他对您的承诺，也是来向您告知……","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"我已经尽最大努力为金石会善后，现在特来向您辞行。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"既然你心意已决，我就不强求了。","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#5$1","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"是。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#2$1","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"告退。","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":301},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clog_fts","volume":"1","id":302},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":303},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"唉，多漂亮的姑娘，就可惜长了颗比乌萨斯的冰原还冷的心。","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"我也是一片好意，她却无论如何不领情，这样的人也算罕见了。","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"不管那么多了。先看看货。","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"大腹便便的议员从装潢奢华的会客室站起身，往深处的一扇小门走去。","id":308},{"type":"dialog","id":309},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"for","fadetime":"2","id":310},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_leathershoes_fts","volume":"0.5","id":311},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":313},{"type":"charslot","id":314},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_bg_64_g15_higashiroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.15","yScale":"1.15","x":"-80","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":318},{"type":"text","text":"令人大跌眼镜的是，那扇小门里没有机密文件，也没有金银珠宝。","id":319},{"type":"text","text":"那里甚至没有多余的娱乐设施，就和一个普通的邋遢东国人居住的单间没什么区别……","id":320},{"type":"text","text":"除了房间中央放着的那台老旧的小钢珠机。","id":321},{"type":"text","text":"这台在锻冶町逃过一劫的机器此刻已经接上了专用的电路，亮了起来，发出失真的音乐声。","id":322},{"type":"text","text":"刚刚还颇有些威严的议员大人已经迫不及待地坐到机器前面，打算玩上一把。","id":323},{"type":"text","text":"他从脚边抓起一筐堆得像小山一样高的小钢珠，打算放进机器里，机器背后忽然传来说话声。","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神明的声音","text":"如愿以偿？","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"是的是的，多谢神明大人保佑，我终于如愿以偿了！","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"也多谢神明大人时隔多日，终于又愿意出现在我家里！","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"您之前在我家待了那么多年，前两天忽然没了踪影，可把我急坏了！我还以为您弃我于不顾了呢！真是久违了！","id":328},{"type":"dialog","id":329},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"for","fadetime":"2","id":330},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":331},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_goldcoin","volume":"1","id":332},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":333},{"type":"text","text":"神明轻巧地跳上钢珠机的顶端。","id":334},{"type":"dialog","id":335},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"4","id":336},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"4","id":337},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suspenseful_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":338,"musicid":1},{"type":"bg","id":339,"from":"0","to":"1","duration":"2","block":"false"},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.15","xScaleTo":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.15","yScaleTo":"1.3","duration":"20","id":340},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1903_1#1$1","bstart":"0.4","bend":"1","duration":"2","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,120","posto":"0,120","duration":"0","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.2","duration":"20","id":344},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"久违的神明","text":"折腾了那么大一通，就为了这台机器？","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"可不是！说起来，我因为这台机器发迹，还不是托您的福嘛！","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"久违的神明","text":"吾辈可不记得自己帮你托过什么福。","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"哪怕后面发生的所有事情您都没有相助，只凭二十年前那件往事，也够我记上一辈子的了！","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"久违的神明","text":"又是那件事？","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"就是那件事啊，让我从一个废人，从一个社会渣滓，变成一个堂堂正正的人的事！","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"久违的神明","text":"早都说过了，那件事跟吾辈没有关系。","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"嗐，您又说这话。想想看，那时我是个什么人？整天在家闲着，也不工作，也没书可读……用现在时髦的话，叫——对，啃老族。","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"每天早上找亲妈要钱，去店里打一把小钢珠。赢了我就觉得这一天运气不错，输了，那就是要倒霉。","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"可就在那天，那个改变我命运的日子，我在街上看见了您的身影。","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"那天我从早上赢到晚上，小钢珠像流水一样从机器里吐出来、吐出来、吐出来，整个店里的托盘都不够装我这一台机器赢的钢珠！","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"久违的神明","text":"然后呢？","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"然后？","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"然后我赢了一大笔，足够去仁田街推车做起小买卖的“一大笔”。毕竟只是小钢珠，我赢的总不可能比那家店值的还多。","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"但您的出现，告诉了我一件事……我不再是废人了。","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"从那一天起，我坚信，自己是被您，被您赠给我的运气……被神明眷顾的人。","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"如果没有您赠给我的运气，我又怎么可能用小钢珠赢来的钱，一步步投机、翻本、勾兑，直到今天？","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"久违的神明","text":"吾辈赠给你的？","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"当然是您赠给我的！","id":375},{"type":"dialog","id":376},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_goldcoin","volume":"1","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1903_1#3$1","posfrom":"200,120","posto":"200,120","duration":"1.5","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.2","duration":"0","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":380},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":381},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":382},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":383},{"type":"charslot","id":384},{"type":"background","id":385},{"type":"curtain","id":386},{"type":"bg","id":387,"from":"1","to":"0","duration":"0.1","block":"false"},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_64_i14.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":388},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.15","yScaleTo":"1.15","duration":"20","block":"false","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":390},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"就说这几天吧，您不是不在吗？我的事情就办得不顺！","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"我让金兵卫那小子把这台钢珠机给我弄回来。本来是很简单的一件事，对不对？","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"但我不可能直接跟他说，于是我说，去把锻冶町拿下，去做个开发计划，顺便去把这台钢珠机弄过来，那东西和我有点因缘。","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"然后一切就乱了套。锻冶町的黑道，龙门的警察，还有金兵卫自己手底下的艺人……乱成了一锅粥，机器也差点没保住。","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"*东国粗口*，要是这台被您眷顾的机器出了什么闪失，把那块河边的烂地建成御机的商业中心，又能有什么用？","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"久违的神明","text":"……","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"而且不止是我，整个御机……整个南院都受您的眷顾，所以我们才发展得这么快，我们的地产才每天涨个不停，对不对？","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"北院的土老帽眉毛都要气歪了，可您不愿过去，他们一点办法都没有。","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"有您的眷顾，我们一定会越来越好，越来越好，直到……","id":400},{"type":"text","text":"议员脸上流下一滴汗珠。不是因为紧张，而是因为眉飞色舞地讲了半天，他已经开始觉得热了。","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员","text":"直到……永远！","id":402},{"type":"text","text":"而他眼前的神明，站在钢珠机的顶端俯视着他……","id":403},{"type":"text","text":"俯视着这间议员秘密买下，连通向这里的电梯都是VIP专属的三十层高级公寓……","id":404},{"type":"text","text":"俯视着将近百米的楼下，喧嚣而嘈杂的御机……","id":405},{"type":"text","text":"而后淡淡地吐出一句祂已经说厌了，却鲜少有人当真的话。","id":406},{"type":"dialog","id":407},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":408},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":409},{"type":"image","id":410},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_bg_64_g15_higashiroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.15","yScale":"1.15","x":"-80","id":411},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1903_1#3$1","id":412},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":413},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"久违的神明","text":"和吾辈有什么关系。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1903_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":416},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_goldcoin","volume":"1","id":417},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":418},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":419},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_goldcoin","volume":"0.5","id":420},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":421},{"type":"text","text":"神明轻巧地跳走，离开狭小的斗室，而早已按捺不住，要上机打上一把的议员并未注意到这一点。","id":422},{"type":"text","text":"那天之后，他再也没有见过神明的身影。","id":423},{"type":"dialog","id":424},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":425},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":426},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":427},{"type":"charslot","id":428},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_bg_64_g7_jinja_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":429},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":430},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":431},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":432},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tech_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_sys_tech_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":433,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#3$1","duration":"1","id":434},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1900_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":435},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":436},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":437},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1900_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"唉。","id":439},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1900_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"唉。","id":441,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_1900_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"他们谈了多长时间了？","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1900_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"至少三个小时了，一点要结束的意思都没有。我能去上个厕所吗，马上回来——","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_1900_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"还想跑是吗？在御机闯了这么大的祸，八大家的家主你一人引来两个，还差点引发南北纠纷，你知道吗？","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1900_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"我家老爷子也就算了，您毕竟也是一方宫司，叶家那头老鹿再怎么说也不能拿你怎么样。","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_npc_1900_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"哪怕不是八大家族，论血脉您也绝对不——","id":450,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_npc_1900_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"口无遮拦！哪怕你自己不想活了，也不要连累你那些朋友们！","id":452,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"居然还给朋友们寄信，说自己要回锁川搞什么灯下黑？要不是你一直在这儿，咳，土下座，现在连他们都要危险了。","id":454,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1900_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"您不也说什么用生命担保萌萌香他们绝无异心，肯定是好人之类的。您这么急公好义，我就去上个厕所——","id":456,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_1900_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"别恭维我了。一会儿叶和锦织两家的家主出来，你要是在这儿还好说，要是跑了……呵。","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ad/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1900_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"呜……","id":460,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_1900_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"唉。","id":462,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"肚子饿了吗？饿了我这儿有竹轮，先凑合吃点吧。","id":463,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1900_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"多谢……","id":465,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_1900_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":466},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":467},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1900_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"那个，宫司大人，我听神社的人说，您有个女儿？","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_1900_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"是啊，比你小一些。","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1900_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"您会不会像刚刚凶我一样凶她啊？","id":473,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_1900_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":474},{"type":"text","text":"神职愣了一愣，像是看什么不可理喻、无法交流的生物一样看了更纱一眼。","id":475},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1900_1#4$1","focus":"n","id":476},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"我？凶丽萨？你在想什么？","id":478,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1900_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"毕竟她不是也像我一样偷偷溜走了吗？我好歹还在东国境内呢，她据说都跑到叙拉古去了！","id":480,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_1900_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"这个嘛……","id":482,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"下次你要是见到英格丽，让她跟你慢慢解释吧——","id":483,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":484},{"type":"charslot","id":485},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_door","volume":"1","id":486},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":487},{"type":"text","text":"门忽然开了。","id":488},{"type":"text","text":"万幸更纱提前意识到门缝里传来的光线有变，在千钧一发之际回归了土下座的姿势。","id":489},{"type":"text","text":"而宫司也立刻会意，挺直脊背，低下头颅，侍立一旁。","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿戈尔男性","text":"那么，请再次容许我代表锦织家向您，向叶家致歉。锦织家管教后辈无方，给叶家添了麻烦，万分抱歉。","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃拉菲亚女性","text":"您言重了。大事都已谈妥，我还要感谢令爱给了我们双方一个当面交流的机会。","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃拉菲亚女性","text":"御机出了如此颟顸无能的议员，纵容暴力团逞凶，令爱也是路见不平而已，何错之有？","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃拉菲亚女性","text":"至于您好奇的神明行踪……恕我冒昧，暂且还是顺其自然，最为妥当……","id":494},{"type":"text","text":"两位家主缓缓走过神社的庭园，走向神域的出口，仿佛全然未曾注意到，自己身后还有一跪一站的两个人。","id":495},{"type":"dialog","id":496},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":497},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1900_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,-20","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"更纱","text":"这……算是平安过关了吗？","id":499,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_1900_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#8$1","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的宫司","text":"姑且算是——","id":501,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":502},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿戈尔男性","text":"更纱，该回家了。","id":503},{"type":"text","text":"苍老的阿戈尔男性站定在神社的入口处，若无其事地唤了一声。","id":504},{"type":"text","text":"更纱愣了半晌，原本因逃过一劫而高兴得通红的脸颊一下子白了下去。","id":505},{"type":"text","text":"她抬头看了看神社这方被圈起来的天空，闭上双眼，在自以为父亲看不到的地方握紧了拳头……","id":506},{"type":"text","text":"然后，换上一副乖巧而木然的表情，小步跟上父亲，缓缓离去。","id":507},{"type":"dialog","id":508},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":509},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":510},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":511},{"type":"charslot","id":512},{"type":"background","id":513},{"type":"image","id":514}],"characters":["林雨霞","诗怀雅","文月","星熊","森内","萌萌香","吉星","澪","？？？","议员","神明的声音","久违的神明","沉稳的神职","更纱","阿戈尔男性","埃拉菲亚女性","沉稳的宫司"]}